# Polar resume ingest

If an application needs a resume file, upload
`resumes/Perfect Resume/perfect_resume.pdf`.

Use that file when the widget is empty, Simplify Copilot leaves it empty,
Copilot cannot drive the ATS resume control, or Polar would otherwise guess
among family variants.

A resume already visible on the widget may stay. Do not replace a filled
widget unless it is wrong or empty after autofill.

Do not upload `resumes/base/JZ_resume.pdf`. Do not generate a resume from a
JD. Canonical policy: `knowledge/polar_resume_attach.yaml`.
